*  DEXP_driver - exercises DEXP(PROTO): define a function in terms of a simple
*  one-line expression.  Case 1 is the header's own worked example verbatim,
*  DEXP('AVE(X,Y) = (X + Y) / 2.0').
-INCLUDE "DEXP.sno"
        DEXP('AVE(X,Y) = (X + Y) / 2.0')
        OUTPUT  =  AVE(1, 3)
        OUTPUT  =  AVE(7, 8)
        DEXP('SQ(X) = X * X')
        OUTPUT  =  SQ(9)
        DEXP('  TWICE(S) = S S')
        OUTPUT  =  TWICE('ab')
END
